emerge_transfer -- sharing is a GENE, and TRANSFER is what pays for it
N=12. motif K=3 planted at 1 of 10 positions; train on 3, select on 3, report on 4.
max-pool readout (position never reaches the output). energy = params/(21*10):
  shared = taps, unshared = taps*10. objective = heldout_acc - 2.00*energy.
60 seeds x 200 epochs. GA: pop 24, 50 gens, flips offsets AND the sharing gene.

SUBSCAN  every subset of the 7-wide window at lo=7 (128 supports), shared, LAMBDA=2.00, 60 seeds
SUBSCAN  the planted target is the contiguous run of 3 at offset 9 (mask 0x1c)
